          "path": "_m/u/1/7/f/exposure-sculpture-wp/exposure-by-antony-gormley-01.jpg",
          "filename": "Exposure by Antony Gormley 01.jpg",
          "caption": "Sculpture \"Exposure\" by Anthony Gormley under construction in Scotland\n\nHad-Fab located in Macmerry, East Lothian, Scotland are currently using Tekla Structures to model the new statue designed by sculptor Antony Gormley. His sculptures, often based on casts of his own body, adorn public spaces and galleries across the country, from well-known works like 'Angel of the North' to his newest creation 'Exposure'. Exposure, a 25.6m high statue depicting a crouching man is due on site in the summer of 2010 in Lelystad, Holland",
          "alt": "Sculpture \"Exposure\" by Anthony Gormley under construction in Scotland\n\nHad-Fab located in Macmerry, East Lothian, Scotland are currently using Tekla Structures to model the new statue designed by sculptor Antony Gormley. His sculptures, often based on casts of his own body, adorn public spaces and galleries across the country, from well-known works like 'Angel of the North' to his newest creation 'Exposure'. Exposure, a 25.6m high statue depicting a crouching man is due on site in the summer of 2010 in Lelystad, Holland",
          "width": 1517,
          "height": 910,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
